  "title": "Air Fryer Chicken Drumsticks",
  "description": "These air fryer chicken drumsticks are coated with perfectly seasoned crispy cornflakes and air-fried until tender and juicy in just 20 minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "Bren"
  ],
